  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Asian Silk Roads World Heritage Serial and Transnation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase II of the project &quot;Support for the Asian Silk Roads World Heritage Serial and Transnational Nomination(s)&quot; is designed to continue the progress made in Phase I, particularly by: (1) Continuing and further developing the ICOMOS Silk Roads Thematic Study covering Eastern Asia and Western Asia, with active support from the participating countries; (2) Facilitating the coordination mechanism for the identified Silk Roads nomination(s); and (3) Providing technical and financial support to Asian Developing Countries for the priority transnational heritage corridors for the Silk Roads nomination process.</narrative>
  </description>
